  <NOTES 0 0
  |ICST HOA Reaper Session v4 - ICST Kompositionsstudio
  |
  |Studio reference from docs
  |- ICST Kompositionsstudio loudspeaker setup
  |- 17 loudspeakers on channels 1-17
  |- Voice of God = loudspeaker 17
  |- Sub/LFE = channel 18
  |- Room approx. 7m x 7m x 7m
  |
  |Recommended signal flow
  |SRC tracks -> HOA BUS 64ch -> ICST MULTIDECODER MAIN -> Studio speaker outputs
  |SRC tracks -> HOA BUS 64ch -> BINAURAL CHECK -> headphones
  |
  |Session steps
  |1. Check RME / device settings for the Kompositionsstudio session.
  |2. Insert ICST MonoEncoder or MultiEncoder on the source tracks.
  |3. Route sources to HOA BUS.
  |4. Insert ICST MultiDecoder on ICST KS MULTIDECODER MAIN.
  |5. Load the Kompositionsstudio speaker preset or rebuild it from the documented coordinates.
  |6. Confirm channel mapping for LS 1-17 and Sub/LFE on channel 18.
  |7. Run test all speakers in clockwise order and confirm physical order in the room.
  |
  |Track groups
  |- 10-15 = source layer
  |- 20 = HOA bus
  |- 30-33 = decoder and monitoring
  |- 90 = print / export
  >
